ndroid","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2909900850,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTA5OTAwODUw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:export","name":"topic:export","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2025-03-14T18:00:52Z","updated_at":"2025-03-15T00:36:03Z","closed_at":"2025-03-15T00:35:49Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in: 4.4.0 stable and 4.4.1 rc1\n\n### System information\n\nArchLinux - Godot 4.4.0 - 4.4.1 rc1\n\n### Issue description\n\nExporting to Android is getting a BIG APK or AAB file\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new project from scratch (Using the Mobile Renderer)\n2. Download your Export template and install it \n3. Install the Android Build Template (from Godot Editor)\n4. Export to Android (from Godot Editor)\n5. Check the Use Gradle Build (from Godot Editor)\n6. Export the project (from Godot Editor)\n\nThe next APK or AAB is about 340Mb, WHY?\n\nif you uncheck the Use Gradle Build (from Godot Editor)\n\nI got 106Mb an APK or AAB, again WHY?\n\nSo we have 340Mb vs 106Mb\n\nI'm using jdk-17.0.14+7 (JDK) from https://adoptium.net\n\nNot reproducible with Godot 4.4 rc2 and using Native platforms arm64-v8a, armeabi-v7a, x86, x86_64 the original file size is 105Mb an AAB file\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nYou can use https://github.com/godotengine/godot-demo-projects/tree/master/2d/dodge_the_creeps to test it","closed_by":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.gi